// Template for the local build env file.
//
// Copy this to Config/Secrets.xcconfig (which is GITIGNORED — never committed)
// and fill in your Azure Translator values:
//     cp Config/Secrets.example.xcconfig Config/Secrets.xcconfig
//
// The extension reads these at build time (via Info.plist) as a hard-coded
// fallback. A key entered in the app's settings always overrides them; leave the
// real file empty to use the in-app settings or the free MyMemory fallback.
//
// Azure Translator subscription key (KEY 1):
AZURE_TRANSLATOR_KEY =
// Azure resource Location/Region short code, e.g. westeurope:
AZURE_TRANSLATOR_REGION =
